<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_align_left"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Ablation study on different loss function combinations. <span id="A1.T4.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">CE</span>: Cross-Entropy Loss; <span id="A1.T4.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">LPIPS</span>: Learned Perceptual Image Patch Similarity; <span id="A1.T4.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Identity</span>: Identity Consistency Loss; <span id="A1.T4.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Facial</span>: Facial Similarity Loss. <math id="A1.T4.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\downarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↓</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math>: lower is better; <math id="A1.T4.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\uparrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↑</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math>: higher is better. Bold = best; underlined = second best per column.</figcaption>
